flowchart TD
    subgraph Input
        A1[Raw RGB Images] --> B1[Group by dish_id]
    end

    subgraph Batched Preprocessing
        B1 -->|Mini-batches of 8| C1{Parallel Paths}
        
        C1 --> D1[GLPN Depth]
        D1 -->|Resize 480x480| D2[AMP Autocast Inference]
        
        C1 --> E1[SAM 2 Segmentation]
        E1 -->|Resize 512x512| E2[Reduced Point Grid]
        
        D2 --> F1[Composite Assembly]
        E2 --> F1
        F1 -->|Resize 224x224| F2[5-Channel Tensor]
        
        D2 -->|Point Cloud| H1[Scipy Convex Hull]
        H1 -->|Explicit Volume Scalar| H2[volumes.csv]
    end

    subgraph Output
        F2 -->|Saved as .pt| G1[datasets/processed/features/]
        G1 --> I1{Fusion Head}
        H2 --> I1
        I1 --> G2[ViT Regressor Training]
        G2 -->|Predicts| G3[log1p Mass Targets]
    end